flowchart TB
  U[Planner or agricultural adviser] --> WEB[Next.js BlueSense interface]
  WEB --> API[FastAPI typed API]
  SOURCES[Open-Meteo / AQUASTAT / CSR GRACE] --> INGEST[Validated ingestion and sync logs]
  INGEST --> DB[(SQLite with provenance)]
  SEED[Committed processed seed data] --> DB
  API --> DB
  API --> ENGINES[Shared water balance / FAO-56 / scenario / allocation engines]
  ML[Offline time-split RF and XGBoost training] --> ART[Stored metrics / predictions / SHAP]
  ART --> API
  WEB --> COPILOT[Server-side read-only Copilot tool loop]
  COPILOT --> API
  COPILOT --> CLOUD[Configured Gemini or Anthropic provider]
  API --> LIMITS[Source dates / uncertainty / missing-data states]
